WEBVTT

00:40:59.162 --> 00:41:03.184
But I have faith in human ingenuity
that we'll figure it out,

00:41:03.208 --> 00:41:04.823
and we'll pivot over,

00:41:04.847 --> 00:41:07.046
and then we'll ratchet up again.

00:41:07.070 --> 00:41:11.315
So I do think that our core problem
right now is social isolation

00:41:11.339 --> 00:41:12.832
and social fragmentation,

00:41:12.856 --> 00:41:15.244
loss of trust, loss of social capital.

00:41:15.268 --> 00:41:19.023
And if we built a society
based on our affections --

00:41:19.047 --> 00:41:22.889
and I always get woo-woo and gooey,
because that is the real stuff.

00:41:22.913 --> 00:41:25.016
What are our affections that bind us?

00:41:25.040 --> 00:41:26.523
There are sort of four things.

00:41:26.547 --> 00:41:28.238
There's our kids.

00:41:28.262 --> 00:41:30.142
We rally around our kids.